<title>MEXICO: Mexico Cetes rate falls sharply in late trade.</title>
<headline>Mexico Cetes rate falls sharply in late trade.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican overnight Cetes rates sharply extended earlier falls and were down 275 basis points at 17.25 percent in late trade on Thursday.</p>
<p>Traders said rates fell after speculative selling by dealers that had previously withheld paper.</p>
</text>
